#! Semantic tokens (s134), under the helix profile: the whole of
#! `resolve/two_mod/main.lu` (keywords; `geometry` a namespace; `area`
#! a function reached across files; `main` a function declaration), then
#! the one line with the call as a range request — the same stream,
#! clipped. Columns are in the negotiated encoding's units.
name      annotate/semanticTokens-helix
profile   helix

initialize
open      resolve/two_mod/main.lu
wait      diagnostics resolve/two_mod/main.lu
req       semanticTokens resolve/two_mod/main.lu
req       semanticTokens resolve/two_mod/main.lu 11:0-12:0
open      hello.lu
wait      diagnostics hello.lu
req       semanticTokens hello.lu
shutdown
